OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1786965500
OL,3,CMotorhome does U-turn on A1 after
OL,4,Cgoing wrong way
OL,6,FWatch the moment a campervan makes a U-
OL,7,Fturn in the middle of the A1.
OL,9,FFootage captured on a dashcam has
OL,10,Fshown a campervan forced to make a u-
OL,11,Fturn in the middle of a dual
OL,12,Fcarriageway section of the A1 in
OL,13,FNorthumberland after ending up on the
OL,14,Fwrong side of the road.
OL,16,FThe video, captured by a local wagon
OL,17,Fdriver, shows the vehicle making the
OL,18,Fmanoeuvre after traveling south on the
OL,19,Fnorthbound carriageway near the
OL,20,FSwarland junction.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
