OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1786965500
OL,3,CMotorhome does U-turn on A1 after
OL,4,Cgoing wrong way
OL,6,FNobody was injured and the vehicle was
OL,7,Fable to turn around but local
OL,8,Fcouncillors argued the footage
OL,9,Fdemonstrates the urgent need for
OL,10,Fsafety improvements on the stretch of
OL,11,Froad.
OL,13,FCouncillor Guy Renner-Thompson,
OL,14,FConservative representative of the
OL,15,FBamburgh ward and cabinet member at
OL,16,FNorthumberland County Council, said:
OL,17,F"This is just further evidence that
OL,18,Fthis road isn't fit for purpose.
OL,26,@yD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1786965500
OL,3,CMotorhome does U-turn on A1 after
OL,4,Cgoing wrong way
OL,6,F"It is being added to the dossier the
OL,7,FNorthumberland A1 Road Safety Alliance
OL,8,Fcampaign group are producing and it
OL,9,Fwill also be seen by officers at the
OL,10,Fcouncil. It is further proof for the
OL,11,FGovernment that this road needs
OL,12,Fsorting out."
OL,14,FMuch of the A1 in Northumberland
OL,15,Fremains single carriageway and
OL,16,Fcampaigners have been calling for
OL,17,Fthese sections to be made dual
OL,18,Fcarriageway for decades.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1786965500
OL,3,CMotorhome does U-turn on A1 after
OL,4,Cgoing wrong way
OL,6,FThere are some short sections that are
OL,7,Falready dualled, including the stretch
OL,8,Fthat passes Swarland.
OL,10,FHowever, there is now concern that
OL,11,Fmany junctions on these sections are
OL,12,Fno longer fit for purpose and require
OL,13,Fsignificant upgrades.
OL,15,FThere has been a rise in the level of
OL,16,Ftraffic using the road in recent years
OL,17,Fwith the North Northumberland coast
OL,18,Fbecoming a particular hotspot for
OL,19,Ftourists.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1786965500
OL,3,CMotorhome does U-turn on A1 after
OL,4,Cgoing wrong way
OL,6,FNorthumberland County Council leader
OL,7,FGlen Sanderson has been calling
OL,8,Fconsistently for the entire route to
OL,9,Fbe upgraded to dual carriageway.
OL,11,FHe feels poor junctions and repeated
OL,12,Fchanges from single to dual
OL,13,Fcarriageway cause confusion for
OL,14,Fvisitors.
OL,16,FHe said: "It's a shocking video.
OL,17,FBecause of the way the A1 is and the
OL,18,Famount of people that are using it,
OL,19,Fpeople simply get confused by the
OL,20,Fjunctions.
OL,26,@xD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1786965500
OL,3,CMotorhome does U-turn on A1 after
OL,4,Cgoing wrong way
OL,6,F"It is that confusion that often leads
OL,7,Fto tragedy. It needs a total rethink."
OL,9,FThe council leader added: "I have
OL,10,Fgreat sympathy with people who get
OL,11,Fconfused."
OL,13,FThe campaign to get the road dualled
OL,14,Fhas been reignited in recent weeks
OL,15,Fafter a number of serious accidents
OL,16,Fthis year that have resulted in
OL,17,Fseveral people losing their lives.
OL,19,FA parliamentary petition calling for
OL,20,Fthe duelling has been signed by almost
OL,21,F3,600 people.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1786965500
OL,3,CMotorhome does U-turn on A1 after
OL,4,Cgoing wrong way
OL,6,FThe Northumberland County Council
OL,7,Fleader continued: "I want to keep the
OL,8,Fcampaign on. Every bit of evidence
OL,9,Fhelps to build the case for action
OL,10,Fthat is desperately needed.
OL,12,F"Saying it is not needed is misguided
OL,13,Fand very wrong. I am not going to
OL,14,Faccept this situation, and we will
OL,15,Fcontinue to fight and express our
OL,16,Fviews on behalf of all the people
OL,17,Finvolved and those who have suffered."
OL,26,@oD@SOUtD@AOUyD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
