OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1786965500
OL,3,CMotorhome does U-turn on A1 after
OL,4,Cgoing wrong way
OL,6,FThe Government has committed to
OL,7,Fcarrying out safety improvements on
OL,8,Fthe A1 in Northumberland as part of
OL,9,Fthe Road Investment Strategy (RIS).
OL,10,FHowever, the dual carriageway scheme
OL,11,Fis currently off the table, with
OL,12,Fofficials deeming the #500 million
OL,13,Fcost too expensive.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/8
